== the table actions offer no ghost:
count=0
prefix=
== the word list still fills the ghost beside a table action:
count=1
prefix=alpha
== the alias action still fills the ghost:
count=1
prefix=myalias
== a -I spec with only a function keeps the command-name ghost:
count=1
prefix=complete
== a -I spec with a word list fills the ghost:
count=1
prefix=initial_one
